[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4862.043, "timestamp": "01:21:02", "text": "等等，你在說話。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4863.629, "timestamp": "01:21:03", "text": "關於，呃，7點那件事—— 十一，你買的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4865.172, "timestamp": "01:21:05", "text": "十一，你買的 你把它放進，呃，車裡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4866.758, "timestamp": "01:21:06", "text": "你把它放進，呃，車裡 在咖啡機旁邊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4868.429, "timestamp": "01:21:08", "text": "在咖啡機旁邊， 呃，然後你把它們混在一起，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4869.758, "timestamp": "01:21:09", "text": "呃，然後你把它們混在一起， 把它和冰沙混合在一起。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4874.087, "timestamp": "01:21:14", "text": "把它和冰沙混合在一起。你 你指的是冰沙嗎？嗯哼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4876.64, "timestamp": "01:21:16", "text": "你指的是冰沙嗎？嗯哼 我曾經有過這個。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4878.26, "timestamp": "01:21:18", "text": "我曾經有過這個。 我覺得我就是這樣的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4879.396, "timestamp": "01:21:19", "text": "我覺得我就是這樣的人。 嚐過了。是的，我就是這樣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4880.923, "timestamp": "01:21:20", "text": "嚐過了。是的，我就是這樣。 嚐過了。巧克力"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4882.466, "timestamp": "01:21:22", "text": "嚐過了。巧克力 還有草莓冰沙，以及"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4886.517, "timestamp": "01:21:26", "text": "還有草莓冰沙，以及 芒果。我就是這個。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4888.025, "timestamp": "01:21:28", "text": "芒果。我就是這個。 試過了。我有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4892.25, "timestamp": "01:21:32", "text": "試過了。我有 生活小妙招，因為當"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4893.277, "timestamp": "01:21:33", "text": "生活小妙招，因為當 把它加到冰沙裡喝掉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4894.475, "timestamp": "01:21:34", "text": "把它加到冰沙裡喝掉。 他似乎沒有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4895.776, "timestamp": "01:21:35", "text": "他似乎沒有。 嚐一嘗，然後似乎就不是這樣了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4897.145, "timestamp": "01:21:37", "text": "嚐一嘗，然後似乎就不是這樣了。 它有甜嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4898.275, "timestamp": "01:21:38", "text": "它有甜嗎？ 差不多是這樣，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4899.542, "timestamp": "01:21:39", "text": "差不多是這樣，對吧？ 是的？這太真實了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4903.431, "timestamp": "01:21:43", "text": "是的？這太真實了， 就像一顆生草莓一樣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4904.835, "timestamp": "01:21:44", "text": "就像一顆生草莓一樣 這是生香蕉嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4906.168, "timestamp": "01:21:46", "text": "這是生香蕉嗎？ 是的？這個，嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4908.537, "timestamp": "01:21:48", "text": "是的？這個，嗯， 果味茶飲口味。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4912.794, "timestamp": "01:21:52", "text": "所以我加了糖"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4914.395, "timestamp": "01:21:54", "author": "@Drop_fpss", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2LTIwKjQXLh3dDyoa6OFkyVkTNd9j0WzfJx2ca6dRYm-KZGwZFVJkWZiTSXOnYoV5EaVM6ah4Q=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yo "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4915.679, "timestamp": "01:21:55", "text": "條紋，對吧？糖"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4918.22, "timestamp": "01:21:58", "text": "事物。我加了糖。"}]